WEBVTT

00:07:58.809 --> 00:08:00.870
I think what we are thinking

00:08:00.870 --> 00:08:06.069
and when we are really relooking at 
what we have learned from that experience,

00:08:06.069 --> 00:08:10.975
a lot of ideas comes to really 
personalized learning, if you would like.

00:08:10.975 --> 00:08:14.975
How can you build a model 
where a student getting to a university

00:08:14.975 --> 00:08:20.009
does not need to really enter
at the same entering point,

00:08:20.210 --> 00:08:24.469
using the same amount of time
or working exactly at the same time,

00:08:24.469 --> 00:08:26.477
which is really during the lecture [hold]?

00:08:26.477 --> 00:08:29.417
What could you do 
in providing more options

00:08:29.417 --> 00:08:33.257
for your students to be able 
to take classes across institutions?